; Mediares interface translations, UTF-8. Key: the English text; value: the translation.
; Escapes in keys and values: \n line break, \t tab, \0 NUL, \= equals sign, \\ backslash.
; {name} placeholders must stay as they are (the order may change).
; One section per language, named like Total Commander's language file: wcmd_rus.lng -> [Rus].
; @name is shown in the settings; @decimal is the decimal separator.
; A copy next to the plugin overrides the built-in strings and may add languages.

[Rus]
@name=Русский
@decimal=,

